Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Bruford was able\Nto dodge that blast of Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.42,0:00:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He moved so fast underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.94,0:00:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was all a blur.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My overdrive barely\Nclansed off his forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know anything\Nless than a solid punch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.44,0:00:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't be enough to send\Nthe Hormone into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My good Lord Dio, I thank\Nthee for this life anew,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I may duel with\Nthis stout-hearted lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My heart would swell to\Nbursting if it still beats.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.52,0:00:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In blood and deed, he\Nis the stuff of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we will fight in our native element.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.06,0:00:59.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is by mastery of our arts and strength\Nof our spirits that we wage this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bear your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold nothing back lest you not\Nsurvive beyond this moment.
