Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.36,0:01:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.04,0:01:42.17,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora! Koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.04,0:01:42.17,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Two stars fall from the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.04,0:01:42.17,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.25,0:01:49.84,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikari to yami no minamo suikomareteyuku
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.25,0:01:49.84,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One shining in the light, the other sinking into darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.84,0:01:55.26,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikiau you ni kasanaru hamon
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.84,0:01:55.26,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,A ripple drawing the two of them together
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.68,0:02:06.31,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyo no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.68,0:02:06.31,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of pride and receive the sun's guidance
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.68,0:02:06.31,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyou no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to build a way\Nof the power of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you are finding the way of\Nthe world, the path of the world!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.31,0:02:12.45,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yabou no hate wo mezasu mono ni
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.31,0:02:12.45,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of unbridled ambition...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.80,0:02:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.45,0:02:13.86,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.45,0:02:13.86,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Demanding sacrifice!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.45,0:02:13.86,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to live with the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to live with
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.70,0:02:24.58,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Furueru hodo kokoro moetsukiru hodo atsuku
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.70,0:02:24.58,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that burning in your soul calm the trembling of your heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the path of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.79,0:02:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to live with\Nthe heart of the world.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.92,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono te kara hanate kodou
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.58,0:02:27.92,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Strike down your fears,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.92,0:02:31.38,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.92,0:02:31.38,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,With courage coursing through your veins!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.92,0:02:31.38,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.38,0:02:38.05,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayoi naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.38,0:02:38.05,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,You cannot overcome your pain unless you can accept...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.38,0:02:38.05,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayou naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.05,0:02:42.06,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.05,0:02:42.06,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.05,0:02:42.06,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.85,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.85,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
