Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmon can only be projected\Nthrough the arms and the legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his arms bound in\Nfront of him like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has no way of blasting through\Nthat infernal hair of Bluford's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:31.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to help him out, but you\Nand me have got things even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think old Tarkus fancies a dust-up.
