Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hair, it's tearing through\Nmy clothes, through my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more I struggle, the tighter it\Nwinds, and it's sucking my blood away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat your petty life, adieu!\NBehold the coup de grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.18,0:04:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take your head and\Nbathe in a fountain of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
