Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watts is not all that conducts\Nhormones, Metal Silver Overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using his sword to hoist Bruford by his\Nown bleeding petard, who thinks of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How my heart resonates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pulsing with heat and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My very blood is a symphony within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunlight, yellow, overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There we go, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.42,0:04:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About time we heard the\Nwelcome crackle of Harmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I pummeled Bluford a moment\Nago, something felt different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.50,0:05:00.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing his past makes his\Npresent corruption all the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take heart, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is that man no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nothing but a zombie,\Neager to spread his evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be the one to end him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.72,0:05:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, I'm the Black Knight, Bruford.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike me as thou wilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This pain is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still dangerous, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.14,0:05:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been missing an arm\Nand scorched all the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.00,0:05:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's laying into Jojo\Nevery bit as ferociously.
