Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have they both gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.86,0:05:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A moment to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said this pain is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:06:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means pain is something\Nyou can feel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.02,0:06:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're blooming all around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now, the hormone ravages the evil\Nthat animates Bluford's long-dead corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see the long forgotten pain came\Nback. Only humans know that sort of ache.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Observe my dear Speed\NWagon his zombie body
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.26,0:06:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,succumbs to the hormone but his noble soul
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is redeemed in the\Nprocess I could sense the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good in you that's why\NI didn't try to dodge
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.60,0:06:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have killed me just now but\Nyou stayed your hand look at his face
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's like all the rage and hatred he\Nhad when Dio brought him back are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.02,0:06:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His features are so gentle he could be a\Nbloke catching up with his oldest mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.58,0:06:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stood there like a statue,\Nready to take the fatal blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oblivion beckoned, but you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:58.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,put your trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your faith in human goodness is rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One side have railed\Nagainst the pain I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, going to my rightful\Nend, I cherish all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that proves me human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gives me joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The embers dull within\Nme, but I am tranquil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is no bitterness left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What irony to live yet again,\Ndying with thanks on my lips for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the very man who slaughters me anew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.58,0:07:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall return to my one true master.
