Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.32,0:07:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would know The name of\Nthe warrior who bested me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:43.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you kindly do me that\Nhonor? It's Jonathan Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Jonathan I leave you\Nthis sword given to me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by my precious queen and\Nthe word engraved upon it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.16,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\fad(250,0)\pos(960,815)\bord3\blur1.7}Good Fortune
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.16,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs(60)\fad(250,0)\pos(960,815)}Good Fortune
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luck but first let me affix my
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.00,0:08:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own benediction pluck sir bluefoot
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.71,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs66\fad(250,0)\pos(960,812)\bord3\blur1.7}Courage!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.71,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs(66)\fad(250,0)\pos(960,812)}Courage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go you to your rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let no one doubt you\Nhave earned it, Bruford.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.74,0:08:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I have to strike\Nhim down to redeem his soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died once before with hate in his\Nheart, but his spirit was still pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He returned not out of choice,\Nbut dragged above by Dio's evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.52,0:08:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His evil in the mosque's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.88,0:08:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will send them both\Nto hell before the dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.06,0:08:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarkus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.38,0:08:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the armor of a\Nsteadfast friend and comrade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died with honor and dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He died like a spineless dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was too clever by half, liked\Nwinning his fights with thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.14,0:08:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hit him until they fall to pieces!
