Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, grab on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.34,0:10:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All human beings, whether\Nadept at Hamon or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,constantly exude a weak magnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An overdrive can increase\Nthe power of that field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.10,0:10:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo and Zeppeli sent it into the leaves,\Ndrawing them together into a solid sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.94,0:10:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're magicians, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd have to be, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you learn to do all of these\Nneat spells in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn good question!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been watching them do\Nit and I still pinch myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oi, Baron, what's the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.60,0:10:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How on earth did you pick\Nup all this mumbo-jumbo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.48,0:10:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Many years ago, my travels took me to\NIndia, where I discovered a mysterious man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.20,0:10:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He called himself a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.24,0:11:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though he was very young and\Nlacked all the tools of the trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.80,0:11:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little did I know, he was more potent\Nof a medic than I'd ever encountered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.98,0:11:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took a gangrenous limb in his hands\Nand healed it with light from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the day I learned of Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd been looking for something with\Nwhich to fight the stone mask's evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and in Hamon, I had found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eager to learn,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.50,0:11:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I crossed into Tibet\Nand up the Salween River
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.06,0:11:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in search of he who had\Ntaught the young healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name was Tonpetty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stranger, these eyes of\Nmine have seen your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:12:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you pursue the mysteries of Harmon\Nas my pupil, your fate is sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:06.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day will come when this\Nwill be the death of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.86,0:12:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.14,0:12:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I must die to end this quest, so be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Tonpedi's prophecy is never far\Nfrom my mind, but I cannot tell them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.04,0:12:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's part of Halmon\Ndoing its thing, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly.
