Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's insane, leaping from that height\Njust to give chase to his foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.68,0:13:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a goodly amount of Hormone\Nholding these leaves together, you brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Painful to the touch for the United.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where the Knights used\Nto train in the olden days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lead to safety, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we get swatted out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:20.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy Blighter, he just slammed\Nhimself straight into the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and thank your lucky\Nstars that he did Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unlike their master, Dio's\Nminions can't regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that should be the\Nlast we see of that beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.20,0:13:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.11,0:13:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he should be mincemeat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.56,0:13:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in death, he has a will of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does his body endure\Nunder such punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's climbing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.66,0:13:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't destroy Dio while\Nthis monster dogs our steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems we have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarkus meets his doom here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, this will be perilous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.62,0:13:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the lad to safety within.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.00,0:14:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's odd about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.18,0:14:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is where they used to train\Nthe knights how to kill people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say it's full of booby traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doc Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's coming at you!
