Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.80,0:14:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorokas!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, caught you good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fleet of foot, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.60,0:14:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now you and me are\Nchained to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.98,0:14:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo had wandered into the\Nlair of the Two-Headed Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:14:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an ancient sparring ground and\Nhome of the Chain Deathmatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.06,0:15:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed 48 men here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking a life's an art\Nform, and I'm a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.90,0:15:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't punch through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That door is solid iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, he's batted his\Nknuckles bloody against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harmon is very versatile,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.00,0:15:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's meant to be used as a\Nrapier, not as a sledgehammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.48,0:15:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bricks I could beat to a powder,\Nbut this door is too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.36,0:15:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo faces a darker dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That chain about his neck is more\Nthan ripple energy can overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.40,0:15:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breaking out of that collar is impossible,\Nand you'll need the key to unlock it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad it's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During a deathmatch, the door to the\Noutside is fashioned to lock tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I have the key to your collar,\Nyou have the one that goes to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the only way that either\Nof us is going to get out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is by taking the other's head!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.06,0:16:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overdrive!
