Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's broken the bone in my forearm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.74,0:16:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a simple thing to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.98,0:16:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little Hormone and I'm good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in order to use Hormone, I need\Nto be free of this damnable collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, this is all so frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.68,0:16:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I wet myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This village was safe\Nuntil these men arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in danger here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.32,0:16:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to get away from all this\Nfighting with the double Pogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a lever, Baron Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No telling for certain, but I think\Npulling on it will open this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting Tarkus is a daunting\Nenough task as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never mind doing it fresh out\Nof a battle with Blueford.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.14,0:17:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, hella high water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.56,0:17:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must find a way to get\Nin there and help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's locked up tighter than a nunnery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so narrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try as they might, they\Ncould never squeeze through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.66,0:17:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could batter this door\Ntill Judgment Day to no avail!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have to use the\Ncliffside entrance Tarkus used!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that'll take too much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time that he don't got!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.34,0:17:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but we've no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always on the bleeding sidelines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm powerless, there's\Nnothing I can do to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.40,0:17:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at me, brat, I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said look at me, are you stupid or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's such a little scary cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.28,0:18:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a baby, he's shaking like a leaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, fellas, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh is the baby going to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.38,0:18:24.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sis, it's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poco, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're letting those boys bully you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do this all the time Why not\Ntry standing up to them for once?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bloody their noses!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will When? Tomorrow? In a year?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.22,0:18:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poco, what frightens you\Nmore than anything else?
