Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.54,0:19:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that hurt, but\Nyou're still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pain's not the worst thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something far worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's growing up being too\Nafraid to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a life would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.06,0:19:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.96,0:19:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Poco.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.30,0:19:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get you home in some clean clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poco!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A window!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oi, lad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's brave, but going in\Nthere's gonna be the end of ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.92,0:19:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speedwagon, get the boy down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A butcher like Tarkus\Ndoesn't care who he kills!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll crush Pogo underfoot like a bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.60,0:19:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.64,0:19:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of this nonsense, Pogo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think of what's gonna happen to\NWinnight's Lot if these monsters win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that Jojo guy gets killed in\Nhere, they'll attack us next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if they hurt Sis?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to keep her safe, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paces!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.26,0:20:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm standing up to them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.46,0:20:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not interfere, you brat!
