Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.30,0:20:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was brave, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.16,0:21:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brave as a bear, my lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nothing that won't heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, Baron, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give that hulking bastard the what for!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.20,0:21:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeppeli?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day will come when this\Nwill be the death of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fine, is tonight the\Nnight that I go to my grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.72,0:21:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fate is a fickle mistress,\Nbut I cannot deny her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeppeli!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you sound so dire?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.26,0:22:05.85,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The words will make you out and out.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.85,0:22:09.39,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.36,0:22:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.39,0:22:14.73,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.73,0:22:17.40,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.40,0:22:21.90,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.44,0:22:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.90,0:22:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.37,0:22:32.96,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.22,0:22:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.96,0:22:36.50,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I spend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.50,0:22:41.84,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cold in morning driving through the sun.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.84,0:22:44.47,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.47,0:22:48.51,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And around the lake.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.51,0:22:50.89,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.94,0:22:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.14,0:22:54.35,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.35,0:22:56.15,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.27,0:23:02.94,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.30,0:23:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over, we'll be\Nthere and we'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten and two summers, we'll be\Nthere and I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.74,0:23:09.41,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.16,0:23:15.83,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty, four, five mile\Nover, we'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.83,0:23:18.79,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.59,0:23:28.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,700)\bord5.5\blur2}Next Episode
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.59,0:23:28.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,700)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.90,0:23:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bloody savagery is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Tarkus!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pathetic waste of flesh! Jojo! Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.94,0:23:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it yours!
